OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over murder of woman
OL,4,Ain her own home
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have arrested a man over the
OL,7,Fmurder of a woman found beaten to death
OL,8,Fin her own home.
OL,10,FRose Johnston, 68, was discovered at
OL,11,Fher home in the Dovecot area of
OL,12,FLiverpool on 4 October 2025. A man in
OL,13,Fhis 30s was arrested in the following
OL,14,Fweeks but was released under
OL,15,Finvestigation.
OL,17,FNearly 12 months on, Merseyside Police
OL,18,Fdetectives working on the case have
OL,19,Fsaid they have arrested a 64-year-old
OL,20,Fman on suspicion of murder.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
