OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over murder of woman
OL,4,Ain her own home
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Catherine Walsh said:
OL,7,F"Although we have made a second arrest
OL,8,Four enquiries remain ongoing and it is
OL,9,Fvital that anybody with information who
OL,10,Fhasn't already come forward does so as
OL,11,Fa matter of urgency."
